# ---- Personal data: never commit ----------------------------------------------
# Photos, sound and disc mirrors copied off a camera.
/downloads/
# Serial traces contain every byte read from the disc (photos, sound). Share traces only after
# running app/tools/sanitize_trace.py, and put them somewhere deliberate (e.g. a test fixture).
/md1tool/logs/
**/serial-*.log
# Disc folders made by the app or md1tool, wherever they end up.
**/listing.txt
**/disc-manifest.txt
**/disc.json
# Your edits: places (GPS coordinates) and dates of your photos.
**/edits.json
*.PMP
*.PMA
*.PMX
*.PMF
*.wav
*.aea
photo-metadata.csv

# ---- Third-party material we may not redistribute -------------------------------
# Sony's "Digital Still Camera Utility 1.5" CD image and the camera's instruction manual
# (see docs/references.md for where to find them), saved web pages, and the cheat-sheet
# diagrams that are drawn on top of the manual's illustrations.
*.iso
*.pdf
/Info/
/cheatsheet/MD1-diagram-*.png

# ---- Build output / environments -----------------------------------------------
node_modules/
/app/dist/
/app/target/
/app/src-tauri/gen/
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# ---- OS / editor clutter --------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
